{"ref":"BDB, שְׁגָגָה","hw":"שְׁגָגָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁגָגָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. sin of error, inadvertence</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:25\" href=\"/Numbers.15.25\">Nu 15:25</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁגְגָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.18\">Lv 5:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁגְגָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:25\" href=\"/Numbers.15.25\">Nu 15:25</a>;—<em>error</em> (opp. sins of intention, or <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיָד רָמָה</span>) only P Ec: <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:25\" href=\"/Numbers.15.25\">Nu 15:25</a> = <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.5\">Ec 5:5</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:5\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.5\">Ec 10:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">על שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:18\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.18\">Lv 5:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:25\" href=\"/Numbers.15.25\">Nu 15:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חטא בִּשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:2\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.2\">Lv 4:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.22\">22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:15\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.15\">5:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:27\" href=\"/Numbers.15.27\">Nu 15:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:28\" href=\"/Numbers.15.28\">28</a> + (vb. om.) v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:26\" href=\"/Numbers.15.26\">26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עשׂה בִשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.22\">Lv 4:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:29\" href=\"/Numbers.15.29\">Nu 15:29</a> + <span dir=\"rtl\">(לִשׁ׳)</span> v <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:24\" href=\"/Numbers.15.24\">24</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אכל קֹדֶשׁ בִּשׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:14\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.14\">Lv 22:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַכֵּה־נֶפֶשׁ בִּשׁ׳</span> of unintended killing <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:11\" href=\"/Numbers.35.11\">Nu 35:11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:15\" href=\"/Numbers.35.15\">15</a> = <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:3\" href=\"/Joshua.20.3\">Jos 20:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 20:9\" href=\"/Joshua.20.9\">9</a> (‖ in D <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּבְלִי־דַעַת</span>).—<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:24\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.24\">1 S 14:24</a> v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁגָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁגָה\", dir=\"rtl\">שׁגה</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁגָּיוֹן","prev":"BDB, שָׁגַג"}